WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.870 --> 00:00:02.970
ARTHUR BROOKS: What makes you happy?

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:06.540
Would more money, a new relationship,
job, or maybe even a pet

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:08.340
make you happier?

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:11.650
Maybe to be happier, you should
give up all of these things

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:14.370
and go meditate on
the top of a mountain.

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:17.490
Or perhaps happiness
is out of your control,

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:22.020
and you're just programmed to
enjoy it a lot or a little.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.460
If you want to have a truly happy
life, what do you need to focus on?

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:28.770
What should your goals be?

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:31.710
These questions have
puzzled humanity forever,

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:34.840
and many people think
they can't be answered.

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:39.240
It turns out that there's a huge
body of science on human happiness.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:43.060
Who has it, what causes it,
and the biggest mistakes

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:45.810
we all make when we're
trying to acquire it.

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:49.770
This is a course that brings
all this information to you.

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:53.010
But it does more than just
give you facts and data.

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:57.030
It also teaches you how to use it
in your life, so you can get happier

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:58.860
no matter where you start out.

00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:03.240
I'll show you how philosophy, social
science, history, and brain science

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:05.850
all come together to give
us the secret to living

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:08.400
fuller, more meaningful lives.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:10.590
And I'll teach you
the exercises you need

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:13.650
to make these secrets a
permanent part of your life

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:16.380
and share them with the people you love.

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:18.570
Everybody wants to be happier.

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:24.020
You can make yourself happier,
and this course will show you how.

